},"references":{"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"abstract":[{"text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s ","type":"text"},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","title":"Swami","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/onDrop(of:isTargeted:perform:)-4duqz":{"title":"onDrop(of:isTargeted:perform:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/onDrop(of:isTargeted:perform:)-4duqz","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/ondrop(of:istargeted:perform:)-4duqz","abstract":[],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"onDrop"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"of"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:22UniformTypeIdentifiers6UTTypeV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UTType"},{"kind":"text","text":"], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"isTargeted"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI7BindingV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Binding"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifie